/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 94 0 R
/T (I did not just trust the dashboard. I checked the aggregate against the raw logs. Splunk grouped the activity, but I still wanted to confirm the timing and recipient ID myself. That was one of the best lessons from the lab: Never quote a number just because the tool gave it to you. Validate it.)
/E (I did not just trust the dashboard. I checked the aggregate against the raw logs. Splunk grouped the activity, but I still wanted to confirm the timing and recipient ID myself. That was one of the best lessons from the lab: Never quote a number just because the tool gave it to you. Validate it.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
