/Title (I analyzed tracking pixels and suspicious links as a defender. Here, I built them in a safe lab. The tracked link logs the click. The 1x1 pixel logs the open. I also ran into a GoPhish tracking-image issue, so I added the tracking pixel manually and validated it later.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 302 0 R
